- Backend: FastAPI + Web3.py.
- Do not introduce SQLite/SQLAlchemy identity or record storage.
- Identity is an Ethereum-compatible wallet verified by signature.
- Do not add patient IDs or person-name metadata to API/storage layers.
- IPFS is authoritative content storage; Pinata is prototype pinning only.
- Besu stores record hash, CID, uploader wallet and timestamp.
- Chroma stores embeddings plus record_hash/chunk_index only; no plaintext documents.
